 "remarks": "Sun-filled and thoughtfully laid out, this 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath condo offers generous square footage, classic brick and vinyl construction, and parking for up to three cars - a rare combination of comfort, convenience, and long-term value in a walkable neighborhood.  Inside, you'll find central heating and cooling, wood flooring (engineered), and a freshly painted interior with ample closet and storage space throughout. The kitchen features newer appliances, including a refrigerator, dishwasher, microwave, and ducted range hood, alongside a new washer and dryer. Residents also enjoy an outdoor swimming pool and discounted internet service.  Just a 15-minute walk to Downtown Stamford and the Metro-North train station, this property is ideal for an owner-occupant or an investor seeking upside potential.  Open House: Saturday 12:00-2:00 PM | Sunday 3:00-4:00 PM",
